                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Inclosure in No. 858.]</seg></opener>
                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Translation from the Nichi Nichi Shimbun, August
                        31, 1878.]</seg></opener>
                <p>The 21st instant (August) being the hundredth day since the assassination of the
                    late Udaijin (junior prime minister, posthumous title given to Mr. Okubo), Mr.
                    Okubo, his family were presented with a gift of 30,000 yen from the imperial
                    household department.</p>
            </div>
